OL,3,ANo similarity between Reform's #72m
OL,4,Adonations and unions giving to Labour,
OL,5,Asays TUC boss
OL,6,
OL,7,FThere is "no similarity" between the
OL,8,F#72m donated to Reform by two
OL,9,Fbillionares, and union members giving
OL,10,Fmoney to Labour, says the Trades Union
OL,11,FCongress boss
OL,13,FThis weekend, Reform announced #36m
OL,14,Fdonations from Christopher Harborne and
OL,15,FBen Delo, who both made money in
OL,16,Fcryptocurrency
OL,18,FReform's deputy leader Richard Tice
OL,19,Fsays his party is "merely trying to get
OL,20,Fon a level playing field"
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
